    </div>
    <div class="tg-steps">
      <div class="tg-step">
        <div class="tg-step-num">01</div>
        <div class="tg-step-title">Book Your Slot</div>
        <p class="tg-step-body">
          Select an available 2-hour Platinum Hours block on the calendar. Spots fill up fast — grab
          your time early.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="tg-step">
        <div class="tg-step-num">02</div>
        <div class="tg-step-title">Complete Group Forms</div>
        <p class="tg-step-body">
